				<title>Education</title>
				<link>https://www.example.org/cv/education/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 02 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://www.example.org/cv/education/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;2025-doctor-of-philosophy---agronomy---university-of-florida&#34;&gt;2025 Doctor of Philosophy - Agronomy - University of Florida&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#2025-doctor-of-philosophy---agronomy---university-of-florida&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;anchor-symbol&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; height=&#34;26&#34; width=&#34;26&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 22 22&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;path d=&#34;M0 0h24v24H0z&#34; fill=&#34;currentColor&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;      &lt;path d=&#34;M3.9 12c0-1.71 1.39-3.1 3.1-3.1h4V7H7c-2.76.0-5 2.24-5 5s2.24 5 5 5h4v-1.9H7c-1.71.0-3.1-1.39-3.1-3.1zM8 13h8v-2H8v2zm9-6h-4v1.9h4c1.71.0 3.1 1.39 3.1 3.1s-1.39 3.1-3.1 3.1h-4V17h4c2.76.0 5-2.24 5-5s-2.24-5-5-5z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;My dissertation was entitled: &lt;em&gt;Statistical Methods for the Modeling of Crop Root System Distribution in Minirhizotron Studies&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;2018-master-of-science---agronomy---university-of-florida&#34;&gt;2018 Master of Science - Agronomy - University of Florida&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#2018-master-of-science---agronomy---university-of-florida&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;anchor-symbol&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; height=&#34;26&#34; width=&#34;26&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 22 22&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;path d=&#34;M0 0h24v24H0z&#34; fill=&#34;currentColor&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;      &lt;path d=&#34;M3.9 12c0-1.71 1.39-3.1 3.1-3.1h4V7H7c-2.76.0-5 2.24-5 5s2.24 5 5 5h4v-1.9H7c-1.71.0-3.1-1.39-3.1-3.1zM8 13h8v-2H8v2zm9-6h-4v1.9h4c1.71.0 3.1 1.39 3.1 3.1s-1.39 3.1-3.1 3.1h-4V17h4c2.76.0 5-2.24 5-5s-2.24-5-5-5z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;My thesis was entitled: &amp;ldquo;&lt;em&gt;Local Perceptions of the Factors Constraining the Adoption of Climate-Smart Practices Among Robusta Coffee (Coffea canephora Pierre Ex a. Froehner) Farmers in Rakai, Uganda&lt;/em&gt;&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
